Package: media-dl
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-tk, python3-venv, python3-pip, python3-pil, python3-pil.imagetk, curl, ca-certificates, ffmpeg, atomicparsley, aria2, mpv, libmpv2 | libmpv1
Recommends: uv, rtmpdump, nodejs, quickjs, python3-brotli, python3-pycryptodome, python3-xattr, python3-secretstorage
Homepage: @URL@
Description: Tk front-end for yt-dlp and gallery-dl
 Downloads videos with yt-dlp and images with gallery-dl, with an embedded
 mpv player, image/thumbnail preview and a yt-dlp extractor picker.
 yt-dlp, gallery-dl, python-mpv, mutagen etc. live in a venv at
 /opt/media-dl/venv that is built with uv when the package is configured.
